[
    {
        "TextId": 1,
        "ActorName": "Vera",
        "ActorTalk": "All those bustling places outside, and you bring me somewhere so quiet and secluded?",
        "Cv": 510002332.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 2,
        "ActorName": "Vera",
        "ActorTalk": "That depends on what exactly you had in mind.",
        "Cv": 510002333.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 3,
        "ActorName": "Vera",
        "ActorTalk": "Just ordering? How boring. Let's make a game of it.",
        "Cv": 510002334.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 4,
        "ActorName": "Vera",
        "ActorTalk": "They have a self-service station, right? How about we each make a drink for the other?",
        "Cv": 510002335.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 5,
        "ActorName": "Vera",
        "ActorTalk": "Look at you, raring to go. I'll start first.",
        "Cv": 510002336.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 6,
        "ActorName": "Vera",
        "ActorTalk": "To handle all kinds of missions, you need a few special skills. Like\u2014being alone in a quiet corner with the Gray Raven Commandant.",
        "Cv": 510002337.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 7,
        "ActorName": "Vera",
        "ActorTalk": "So, Commandant, what kind of flavor are you in the mood for?",
        "Cv": 510002338.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 8,
        "ActorName": "Vera",
        "ActorTalk": "Oh, you do love a challenge. Alright, one \"Gray Raven Commandant\" coming right up.",
        "Cv": 510002339.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 9,
        "ActorName": "Vera",
        "ActorTalk": "Here you go, one \"[PlayerName]\" special. Enjoy!",
        "Cv": 510002340.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 10,
        "ActorName": null,
        "ActorTalk": "(The moment it hits your throat, it's like a burst of fiery spice ignites your taste buds.)",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 11,
        "ActorName": "[PlayerName]",
        "ActorTalk": "Cough\u2014cough\u2014",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 12,
        "ActorName": "Vera",
        "ActorTalk": "Oh dear, that was our \"Blazing Inferno.\" This next one is what you actually ordered.",
        "Cv": 510002341.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 13,
        "ActorName": "Vera",
        "ActorTalk": "So sorry for the inconvenience!",
        "Cv": 510002342.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 14,
        "ActorName": "Vera",
        "ActorTalk": "Hmm... What to do? I know, I'll taste it first for you.",
        "Cv": 510002343.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 15,
        "ActorName": "Vera",
        "ActorTalk": "Now there's no excuse. Your turn, Commandant.",
        "Cv": 510002344.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 16,
        "ActorName": "Vera",
        "ActorTalk": "Tsk. Open up\u2014",
        "Cv": 510002345.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 17,
        "ActorName": "Vera",
        "ActorTalk": "So? How is it?",
        "Cv": 510002346.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 18,
        "ActorName": "Vera",
        "ActorTalk": "You've got taste. I'll remember this \"[PlayerName]\" recipe. When you're craving it again, come beg me for another.",
        "Cv": 510002349.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 19,
        "ActorName": "Vera",
        "ActorTalk": "Hmm... The noise was unbearable, the decor was painfully tacky, and the food? Bland. Out of 100, I'd give it a negative 10.",
        "Cv": 510002350.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 20,
        "ActorName": "Vera",
        "ActorTalk": "But [PlayerName] was reasonably well-behaved at my side. I suppose that's worth about 70 points.",
        "Cv": 510002351.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 21,
        "ActorName": "Vera",
        "ActorTalk": "All together... just enough to pass. You did okay in the \"satisfy Vera\" category.",
        "Cv": 510002352.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 22,
        "ActorName": "Vera",
        "ActorTalk": "As for your \"reward,\" I've already decided.",
        "Cv": 510002353.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 23,
        "ActorName": "Vera",
        "ActorTalk": "Our little \"date\" can go on a little longer... through tonight, until morning comes.",
        "Cv": 510002354.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 24,
        "ActorName": "Vera",
        "ActorTalk": "What are you standing there for? You still owe me a drink.",
        "Cv": 510002355.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 25,
        "ActorName": "Vera",
        "ActorTalk": "I'm curious, [PlayerName]. What do you think a drink called \"Vera\" would taste like?",
        "Cv": 510002356.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 26,
        "ActorName": "[PlayerName]",
        "ActorTalk": "You'll have to wait and see.",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 27,
        "ActorName": "Vera",
        "ActorTalk": "Oh, and let's stop by that photo booth by the entrance later. The way you were eyeing it earlier\u2014so obvious. It was hilarious.",
        "Cv": 510002357.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 28,
        "ActorName": "Vera",
        "ActorTalk": "We've got plenty of time left. And you're not going anywhere until I'm fully satisfied, Commandant.",
        "Cv": 510002358.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 29,
        "ActorName": "Vera",
        "ActorTalk": "Fiery and intense, always bringing me new surprises. That's the impression I have of you, [PlayerName].",
        "Cv": 510002347.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 30,
        "ActorName": "Vera",
        "ActorTalk": "No matter what happens, you stay calm, like some stone statue in a university courtyard. This flavor fits you, doesn't it?",
        "Cv": 510002348.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 31,
        "ActorName": null,
        "ActorTalk": "Not to your liking?",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 32,
        "ActorName": null,
        "ActorTalk": "Want something to drink?",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 33,
        "ActorName": null,
        "ActorTalk": "Sure.",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 34,
        "ActorName": null,
        "ActorTalk": "I'll let you decide.",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 35,
        "ActorName": null,
        "ActorTalk": "Didn't know you could mix drinks.",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 36,
        "ActorName": null,
        "ActorTalk": "Surprise me.",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 37,
        "ActorName": null,
        "ActorTalk": "How about something that tastes like \"Gray Raven Commandant\"?",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 38,
        "ActorName": null,
        "ActorTalk": "(Taste)",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 39,
        "ActorName": null,
        "ActorTalk": "And if this is another prank?",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 40,
        "ActorName": null,
        "ActorTalk": "I'm not drinking that.",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 41,
        "ActorName": null,
        "ActorTalk": "I still don't want to\u2014",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 42,
        "ActorName": null,
        "ActorTalk": "It's got a kick.",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 43,
        "ActorName": null,
        "ActorTalk": "It's pretty mild.",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 44,
        "ActorName": null,
        "ActorTalk": "All in all, not bad. Thanks.",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 45,
        "ActorName": null,
        "ActorTalk": "So, Vera, what do you think of today's celebration?",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 46,
        "ActorName": null,
        "ActorTalk": "That bad, huh...",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 47,
        "ActorName": null,
        "ActorTalk": "You've got high standards.",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 48,
        "ActorName": null,
        "ActorTalk": "As long as you're satisfied.",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 49,
        "ActorName": null,
        "ActorTalk": "You scared me for a second...",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    }
]